flowchart TD

A[POST /api/auth/login]

A --> B[Receive Email & Password]

B --> C[Validate Input]

C --> D{Input Valid?}

D -- No --> E[Return 400 Bad Request]

D -- Yes --> F[Find User]

F --> G{User Exists?}

G -- No --> H[Return Invalid Credentials]

G -- Yes --> I[Verify Password]

I --> J{Password Correct?}

J -- No --> H

J -- Yes --> K[Generate JWT Token]

K --> L[Return Login Success]